      "text": "Day 13 · The Yanacocha Ecological Reserve, at about 3,600 m on the slopes of Guagua Pichincha, famous for its hummingbirds, including the sword-billed hummingbird, great sapphirewing and golden-breasted and sapphire-vented pufflegs. Continue to Hacienda La Ciénega, a historic hacienda in Cotopaxi province. (B, L)",
